# Runtime, generated and DATA folders (Constitution Parts 13.1, 24).
#
# Anything below may contain extracted business data that no longer carries the
# original DRM protection (Part 13.5). It must never reach version control.
#
# EVERY pattern here is ROOT-ANCHORED with a leading slash, on purpose. An
# unanchored `data/` matches a directory of that name at ANY depth, which
# silently excluded `app/data/` — the entire history-engine source layer — from
# the repository. Git reported success; the layer simply was not there.
# Same lesson as .ai/LESSONS.md L-007, in a second tool.

/runtime/
/offline_packages/
/repair_payload/
/release/
/dist/
/build/
/work/

/inbox/
/workspace/
/data/
/archive/
/output/
/runs/
/logs/

*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
*.parquet
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.xlsb
*.xls
*.log

# Generated per task, never committed (Part 20.10).
.ai/CONTEXT_PACK.md
.ai_cache/

# Generated evidence — regenerated by the verifiers on each release.
ARCHITECTURE_EVIDENCE.json
LOCAL_TRANSPORT_EVIDENCE.json

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
